---
import Logo from './Logo.astro';
import SocialIcon from './SocialIcon.astro';
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-night-700 bg-night-900" transition:persist transition:name="site-footer">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-8 text-center">
    <div class="flex justify-center">
      <Logo size="sm" showTagline={false} />
    </div>

    <nav aria-label="フッターナビゲーション" class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-5 text-xs">
      <a href="/spots/" class="text-gold-100/50 transition hover:text-amber-glow">店を探す</a>
      <a href="/map/" class="text-gold-100/50 transition hover:text-amber-glow">路地マップ</a>
      <a href="/about/" class="text-gold-100/50 transition hover:text-amber-glow">本寺小路の歴史</a>
      <a href="/columns/" class="text-gold-100/50 transition hover:text-amber-glow">本寺小路夜話</a>
      <a href="/news/" class="text-gold-100/50 transition hover:text-amber-glow">お知らせ</a>
      <a
        href="https://www.instagram.com/honji.koji/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-night-600 text-gold-100/55 transition hover:border-amber-deep/70 hover:text-amber-glow"
        aria-label="本寺小路ガイド公式Instagramを開く（外部サイト）"
      >
        <SocialIcon platform="instagram" size={17} />
      </a>
    </nav>

    <p class="mt-4 text-xs leading-relaxed text-gold-100/40">
      新潟県三条市 本寺小路エリアの飲食店・店舗情報をご紹介するファンサイトです。営業時間・料金等は変更になる場合がありますので、事前にご確認ください。
    </p>

    <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-gold-100/30">&copy; {year} Honjikoji Guide</p>
  </div>
</footer>
